        final Intent intent = getIntent();
        intent.setFlags(Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK | Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_CLEAR_TASK);
        startActivity(intent);
        return true;
    }
});
```

The code finishes the `Preferences` activity and restarts the app with the new theme, clearing the back stack. This causes confusion because the user doesn't understand why they're no longer seeing the main activity.

The fix should: (1) show an informational Toast message explaining what's happening, and (2) ensure the user returns to `GpsTestActivity` (the main activity) after the restart.

